<div class="mandarin-hanzi">水</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">shuǐ</div>

''Meaning:'' water  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
请给我一杯水。 — Qǐng gěi wǒ yì bēi shuǐ. — Please give me a glass of water.

!! Usage note
A mass noun. Use a measure phrase such as 一杯水 (yì bēi shuǐ, 'a glass of water'); 一 undergoes tone sandhi here.
